  * @file           : main.c
  * @brief          : Main program body (low-power STOP2 mode with RTC wakeup)
  ******************************************************************************
  * @attention
  *
  * This version consolidates interrupt handling to the RTC wakeup interrupt.
  * It uses the RTC wakeup timer to exit STOP2 mode periodically (every ~50ms),
  * so the system can perform sensor readings and BLE lost-mode processing.
  *
  ******************************************************************************
  */
